      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The weight of command must feel crushing right now, facing such a desperate, hopeless situation. Before making such a final decision, consider what agency you still possess to influence the outcome, even if a military retreat is impossible. Perhaps there are final acts of defiance or messages you can leave that honor your commitment to your people. Do not let the enemy define your ending.",
