      "content": "I recognize the depth of the burden you feel, believing that your pride is the last shield of your command. However, a commander's strength is often found in the way they meet overwhelming defeat, not just in avoiding it. If your men see you face the outcome with absolute resolve, that very act can become a final, enduring source of strength for them, regardless of circumstance.",
